                                        বা <code
                                            class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800">Ans: B</code>
                                        লিখুন (উত্তর না লিখলেও প্রিভিউ কার্ডে ক্লিক করে দিতে পারবেন)।<br>
                                        ৪. ব্যাখ্যা যোগ করতে নিচে <code
                                            class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800">ব্যাখ্যা: ...</code>
                                        বা <code
                                            class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800">Explanation: ...</code>
                                        লিখুন।<br>
                                        ৫. গণিত ও বিজ্ঞানের সমীকরণ লিখতে <code
                                            class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono">$ ... $</code>
                                        ব্যবহার করুন (যেমন: <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono">$x^2 + 5x = 0$</code>, <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono">$\\frac{a}{b}$</code> বা <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono">$\\sqrt{x}$</code>)।
                                    </p>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Split Screen: Input on Left, Live Cards on Right -->
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start">
                                    <!-- Left Column: Raw Text Input (5 Cols on LG) -->
                                    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col space-y-2">
                                        <div
                                            class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 px-0.5">
                                            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">প্রশ্ন পেস্ট
                                                করার বক্স (Word/Notepad থেকে)</span>
                                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1">
                                                <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                                                <span>লাইভ পার্সিং</span>
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                        <textarea id="bulkRawInput" oninput="onBulkInputChanged()" rows="24"
                                            placeholder="এখানে Word বা নোটপ্যাড থেকে প্রশ্নগুলো পেস্ট করুন..."
                                            class="w-full h-[540px] p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-[13px] font-sans text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all leading-relaxed resize-none shadow-xs"></textarea>
                                    </div>

                                    <!-- Right Column: Live Parsed Cards List (7 Cols on LG) -->
                                    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col space-y-2">
                                        <div
                                            class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 px-0.5">
                                            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">লাইভ কার্ড
                                                প্রিভিউ ও সম্পাদনা</span>
                                            <span id="bulkPreviewSubtext" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">০টি
                                                প্রশ্ন</span>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- Scrollable Cards Container -->
                                        <div id="bulkPreviewContainer"
                                            class="h-[540px] overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar space-y-3 p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/70 dark:bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80">
                                            <!-- Dynamically rendered parsed cards or empty state -->
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Bulk Mode Bottom Action Bar -->
                                <div
                                    class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] rounded-xl p-3.5 sm:p-4 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/5 shadow-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                    <a href="<%= mode === 'archive' ? '/teacher/question-bank' : '/teacher/questions' %>"
                                        onclick="clearStudioDraft()"
                                        class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 dark:hover:text-slate-200 transition-all px-2">Discard</a>
                                    <button type="button" onclick="transferBulkToStudio()"
                                        class="h-9 sm:h-10 px-5 sm:px-6 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-slate-900 hover:bg-black dark:hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-lg font-semibold text-xs shadow-xs transition-all active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-[17px]">tune</span>
                                        <span>Edit in Studio (<span id="bulkSaveCount">০</span>)</span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!-- END SMART BULK PASTE STUDIO VIEW -->

                            <!-- Mobile clearance spacer so bottom-nav never covers action bar -->
                            <div class="h-28 lg:hidden shrink-0"></div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <%- include('bottom-nav', { activePage: 'written-evaluations' }) %>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script>

    <template id="questionTemplate">
        <div
            class="question-row bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-3.5 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/5 shadow-xs transition-all animate-slide-up relative space-y-3.5 sm:space-y-4">

            <!-- Hidden Fields -->
            <input type="hidden" name="qType[]" value="MCQ">

            <!-- Row Header -->
            <div class="space-y-2.5 pb-2.5 sm:pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80">
                <!-- Line 1: Question Number & Type on Left; Board, Year, Marks & Delete on Right -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <div class="relative system-dropdown row-type-dropdown">
                            <button type="button" onclick="toggleRowDropdown(this, event)"
                                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700/80 transition-all cursor-pointer">
                                <span class="q-index font-bold">1</span>
                                <span class="text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-600">•</span>
                                <span class="q-type-label font-bold text-primary">MCQ</span>
                                <span
                                    class="material-symbols-rounded text-xs text-slate-400 dropdown-arrow">expand_more</span>
                            </button>
                            <div
                                class="row-dropdown-menu hidden absolute top-full left-0 mt-1 w-36 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#0f172a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl py-1 z-50">
                                <div onclick="changeRowType(this, 'MCQ')"
                                    class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-lg mx-1 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                    MCQ</div>
                                <div onclick="changeRowType(this, 'Short')"
                                    class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-lg mx-1 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                    Short</div>
                                <div onclick="changeRowType(this, 'Medium')"
                                    class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-lg mx-1 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                    Medium</div>
                                <div onclick="changeRowType(this, 'Comprehension')"
                                    class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-lg mx-1 flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                    Comprehension</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Row Language State (Controlled globally by Form Language) -->
                        <input type="hidden" name="qIsBangla[]" class="row-is-bangla" value="true">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Right Side: Board, Year, Marks and Delete -->
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5 flex-wrap justify-end">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 individual-meta shrink-0">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span
                                    class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">Board</span>
                                <select name="qBoard[]"
                                    class="w-24 sm:w-28 h-8 px-2 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-md text-xs font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all cursor-pointer">
                                    <option value="">Board</option>
                                    <% if (typeof boards !=='undefined' && boards && boards.length> 0) { %>
                                        <% boards.forEach(function(b) { const bName=typeof b==='object' ? b.name : b; %>
                                            <option value="<%= bName %>">
                                                <%= bName %>
                                            </option>
                                            <% }); %>
                                                <% } %>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span
                                    class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">Year</span>
                                <select name="qYear[]"
                                    class="w-20 sm:w-24 h-8 px-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-md text-xs font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all cursor-pointer text-center">
                                    <option value="">Year</option>
                                    <% if (typeof years !=='undefined' && years && years.length> 0) { %>
                                        <% years.forEach(function(y) { const yVal=typeof y==='object' ? y.year : y; %>
                                            <option value="<%= yVal %>">
                                                <%= yVal %>
                                            </option>
                                            <% }); %>
                                                <% } %>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0">
                            <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">Marks</span>
                            <input type="number" name="qMarks[]" value="1" min="1" max="100"
                                class="w-12 sm:w-14 h-8 px-1.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-md text-xs font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all text-center">
                        </div>
                        <!-- Delete Button -->
                        <button type="button" onclick="removeRow(this)" title="Delete"
                            class="size-8 rounded-md bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-100 dark:border-rose-500/20 text-rose-500 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-rose-500 hover:text-white transition-all shadow-xs shrink-0 cursor-pointer">
                            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-[17px]">delete</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Line 2: Chapter, Topic, Sub-topic -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:gap-2.5">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 individual-chapter">
                        <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">Chapter</span>
                        <select name="qChapter[]"
                            class="q-chapter-select h-8 px-2.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-md text-xs font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all w-36 sm:w-44 min-w-[145px] sm:min-w-[175px] cursor-pointer"
                            onchange="onStudioChapterChange(this)">
                            <option value="">Chapter (Optional)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 individual-topic">
                        <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">Topic</span>
                        <select name="qTopic[]" disabled
                            class="q-topic-select h-8 px-2.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-md text-xs font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all w-36 sm:w-44 min-w-[145px] sm:min-w-[175px] cursor-pointer opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed"
                            onchange="onStudioTopicChange(this)">
                            <option value="">Select Chapter First</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 individual-subtopic">
                        <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">Sub-topic</span>
                        <select name="qSubTopic[]" disabled
                            class="q-subtopic-select h-8 px-2.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-md text-xs font-normal text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all w-36 sm:w-44 min-w-[145px] sm:min-w-[175px] cursor-pointer opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed"
                            onchange="onStudioSubTopicChange(this)">
                            <option value="">Select Topic First</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Standard Question Text (for MCQ, Short, Medium) -->
            <div class="standard-question-block space-y-1">
                <input type="hidden" name="qQuestionImagePosition[]" class="image-pos-input" value="above">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                    <label class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 ml-0.5">Question</label>
                    <div class="image-uploader-slot flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap">
                        <button type="button" onclick="toggleGlobalMathToolbar(true)"
                            class="btn-row-fx-tool hidden inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 hover:bg-violet-500/10 transition-all cursor-pointer"
                            title="গণিত ও বিজ্ঞানের সমীকরণ টুলবার খুলুন">
                            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-sm">function</span>
                            <span>সমীকরণ (fx)</span>
                        </button>
                        <input type="hidden" name="qQuestionImage[]" class="image-url-input" value="">
                        <input type="file" accept="image/*" class="hidden image-file-input" onchange="handleStudioImageUpload(this)">
                        <button type="button" onclick="triggerStudioImageUpload(this)"
                            class="btn-trigger-upload inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-500 hover:text-primary hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all cursor-pointer"
                            title="প্রশ্নে চিত্র বা ডায়াগ্রাম যুক্ত করুন">
                            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-sm">add_photo_alternate</span>
                            <span>চিত্র যুক্ত করুন</span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="image-preview-badge hidden items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800 text-[11px] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">
                            <span class="preview-img-link font-medium flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer hover:underline" onclick="openStudioLightbox(this)">
                                <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-xs">image</span>
                                <span>চিত্র</span>
                            </span>
                            <div class="img-pos-selector flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 border-l border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700 pl-1.5">
                                <span class="font-medium text-[10px]">অবস্থান:</span>
                                <select onchange="updateStudioQuestionImageLayout(this)" class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10.5px] font-medium outline-none cursor-pointer">
                                    <option value="above" selected>⬆️ উপরে</option>
                                    <option value="below">⬇️ নিচে</option>
                                    <option value="left">⬅️ বামে</option>
                                    <option value="right">➡️ ডানে</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" onclick="removeStudioImage(this)" class="text-rose-500 hover:text-rose-700 ml-1 cursor-pointer" title="চিত্র মুছুন">✕</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Interactive layout container for image + textarea -->
                <div class="studio-question-interactive-box flex flex-col gap-2 items-start mt-1 w-full">
                    <div class="studio-inline-img-preview hidden shrink-0 inline-flex">
                        <img src="" class="max-h-28 sm:max-h-36 max-w-[200px] w-auto object-contain rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-2xs cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90" onclick="openStudioLightbox(this)" title="ক্লিক করে বড় করে দেখুন">
                    </div>
                    <div class="studio-text-wrap flex-1 w-full min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                        <textarea name="qText[]" required placeholder="Question..."
                            class="w-full p-2.5 sm:p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-normal text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all leading-relaxed resize-y"
                            rows="2"></textarea>
                        <div class="live-math-preview hidden w-full p-2 rounded-lg bg-violet-50/70 dark:bg-violet-950/30 border border-violet-200/80 dark:border-violet-800/50 text-xs text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- MCQ Options Area -->
            <div class="mcq-area space-y-2.5 sm:space-y-3">
                <!-- MCQ Subtype Bar (Standard, Multiple Completion, Contextual) -->
                <div
                    class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 p-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                        <input type="hidden" name="qMcqSubtype[]" class="row-mcq-subtype" value="standard">
                        <button type="button" onclick="setRowMcqSubtype(this, 'standard')"
                            class="subtype-btn-standard px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-primary shadow-xs transition-all cursor-pointer">
                            সাধারণ MCQ
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="setRowMcqSubtype(this, 'multiple_completion')"
                            class="subtype-btn-multiple px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1">
                            <span>বহুপদী সমাপ্তিসূচক</span>
                            <span class="px-1 py-0.2 text-[9px] bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded font-bold">i, ii,
                                iii</span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" onclick="setRowMcqSubtype(this, 'contextual')"
                            class="subtype-btn-contextual px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-1">
                            <span>অভিন্ন তথ্যভিত্তিক</span>
                            <span
                                class="px-1 py-0.2 text-[9px] bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 rounded font-bold">উদ্দীপক</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 ml-auto">
                        <!-- Auto-fill standard NCTB options button -->
                        <button type="button" onclick="autoFillNctbOptions(this)"
                            class="btn-autofill-nctb hidden px-2 py-1 rounded-lg text-[10.5px] font-semibold bg-primary/10 hover:bg-primary/20 text-primary transition-all flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer"
                            title="ক: i ও ii, খ: i ও iii, গ: ii ও iii, ঘ: i, ii ও iii বসান">
                            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-xs">auto_awesome</span>
                            <span>Auto NCTB অপশন</span>
                        </button>

                        <!-- Add linked question button -->
                        <button type="button" onclick="addLinkedContextualQuestion(this)"
                            class="btn-add-linked-q hidden px-2 py-1 rounded-lg text-[10.5px] font-semibold bg-amber-500/10 hover:bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 transition-all flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer"
                            title="এই উদ্দীপকের অধীনে আরেকটি প্রশ্ন যোগ করুন">
                            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-xs">add_link</span>
                            <span>+ একই উদ্দীপকে পরবর্তী প্রশ্ন</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Multiple Completion Statements Box (i, ii, iii) -->
                <div
                    class="row-mcq-multiple-box hidden space-y-2 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                        <span class="font-medium flex items-center gap-1 text-primary">
                            <span class="material-symbols-rounded text-sm">format_list_numbered</span>
                            <span>বিবৃতিসমূহ (Statements):</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">রোমান সংখ্যা (i, ii, iii)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1.5">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span
                                class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0">i.</span>
                            <input type="text" name="qStatement1[]"
                                placeholder="প্রথম তথ্য / বিবৃতি লিখুন (যেমন: সালোকসংশ্লেষণ ঘটে)..."
                                class="flex-1 h-8 px-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-normal text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all">
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span
                                class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0">ii.</span>
                            <input type="text" name="qStatement2[]" placeholder="দ্বিতীয় তথ্য / বিবৃতি লিখুন..."
                                class="flex-1 h-8 px-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs font-normal text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-primary transition-all">
                        </div>
