খ. [অপশন ২]
গ. [অপশন ৩]
ঘ. [অপশন ৪]
সঠিক উত্তর: গ`;
            } else {
                rawInput.value = `1. [Write your 1st question text here]
A) [First option]
B) [Second option]
C) [Third option]
D) [Fourth option]
